# Official Qwen block-scaled FP8 checkpoint. Native 256K context, vision.
#
# Speculative decoding: native MTP, k=4 (the model ships 1 MTP layer). Re-validated from scratch on
# vLLM v0.31.0 (Model Runner V2, default cudagraph mode -- no PIECEWISE forcing needed), 2026-10-10:
#   sweep (single-stream / concurrency-4 tok/s; 32-trial strict tool gate failures):
#     no spec        8.07 / 31.3   0/32          k=3   16.56 / 66.2   0/32
#     k=2           14.93 / 60.2   0/32          k=4   16.95 / 65.0   0/32  <- chosen
#     k=5           16.29 / 63.4   0/32          k=3+PIECEWISE 16.29 / 64.9  0/32
#     k=3+fp8 KV    16.43 / 58.4   0/32 (KV 1.79M tok, scoring logprobs shift) -- not adopted
#   k=4 also passed a 15-min mixed-load soak (82 ok / 0 err, server log clean) and MMLU via lm_eval
#   local-completions loglikelihood: 0.8526 +/- 0.0142 (n=570, 10/subtask) -- scoring is NOT corrupted.
#   k=3 is within ~3% of k=4 (slightly faster at concurrency 4); k>=5 regresses.
# --max-num-batched-tokens 8192 / --performance-mode interactivity: larger prefill chunks for
# long-context reads, finer cudagraph capture for low-concurrency latency.
#
# Stats (measured 2026-10-10, vLLM v0.31.0-aarch64, MTP k=4):
#   Size:      ~30.9 GB (FP8 block-scaled); KV cache ~950K tokens at GPU_UTIL 0.85 (3.6x at 256K)
#   Decode:    ~16.6-17.0 tok/s single-stream, ~62-65 tok/s aggregate at concurrency 4
#   MMLU:      0.853 (lm_eval loglikelihood, 570 q)
#   Stability: tool gate 0/32 failures, 15-min soak clean

# --- UI metadata ---
UI_LABEL="Qwen3.8-27B-FP8"
UI_DESC="Official Qwen block-scaled FP8 checkpoint with native MTP speculative decoding (k=4). Tuned for long-context + low-concurrency agentic use. ~30.9GB, native 256K context. MMLU ~0.85, ~17 tok/s single-stream, ~62-65 tok/s at concurrency 4."
UI_SIZE="~30.9 GB · FP8 block-scaled · vision · 256K ctx"
UI_SPEED="~17 tok/s single, ~62-65 tok/s conc-4 (measured 2026-10-10)"
UI_USE_CASES="Vision Q&A, Long-context (256K) reading, Agentic tool-use"
EXPERIMENTAL="0"

# --- Serve recipe ---
SERVE_MODEL="Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B-FP8"
SERVED_NAME="qwen3.8-27b-fp8"
SERVE_CONTAINER="swap-vllm-qwen3.8-27b-fp8"
SERVE_PORT="8002"
MAX_LEN="262144"
GPU_UTIL="0.85"
QUANT="fp8"
TOOLS="1"
REASONING_PARSER="qwen3"
KV_ARG=""
GENCFG_ARG=""
EXTRA_ARGS="--max-num-batched-tokens 8192 --performance-mode interactivity"
SPEC_ARG="--speculative-config '{\"method\":\"mtp\",\"num_speculative_tokens\":4}'"
COMPILE_ARG=""
